-- ============================================================================
-- 022: every Gestion privilege the desktop app knows, on the live database.
--
-- A shop's own computer adds its catalogue at start-up (DatabaseSeeder); the licence server
-- on PostgreSQL does not, so privileges that exist only in Lonnii Desktop - "Voir toutes les
-- ventes" for the pharmacy cashier above all - were missing here. Without the row, a grant
-- made from a phone or from afar has nothing to point at, and a shop pulled onto a new
-- computer loses that grant on the way.
--
-- Generated from Lonnii.Shared PrivilegeCatalog.Gestion. Additive only: a privilege already
-- present is left exactly as it is.
-- ============================================================================

BEGIN;

ON CONFLICT (name) DO NOTHING;

COMMIT;
